{
  "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Monsters Roll No Dice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,829,851]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All the dice rolls in the game are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,851,886]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "performed by you, the player, from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,886,921]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the point of view of your character.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,921,958]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The power of a monster is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,958,984]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "indicated by a number, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,984,1011]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster’s “level”, abbreviated as L.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1011,1048]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you attack, you roll a die and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1048,1084]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "compare it to the monster’s L to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1084,1117]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "determine if the monster is killed.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1117,1153]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When it is the monster’s turn to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1153,1186]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack, you perform a defense roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1186,1221]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "versus the monsters' L, taking\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1221,1252]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-monsters-roll-no-dice:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wounds if the defense roll fails.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1252,1286]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    7
  ]
}
